# This file is no longer the primary source of local configuration.
#
# Local environment configuration lives in config/local.env (committed).
# .env.local is generated automatically by:
#
#   make setup      — copies config/local.env → .env.local (one-time)
#   make bootstrap  — does the same as part of the full bootstrap
#
# To customise your local environment, edit config/local.env directly.
# Sensitive overrides (e.g. a real Stripe test key) can be appended to
# .env.local after generation — .env.local is gitignored.
